          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Human Rights and Humanitarian Concerns</strong><br>\nThe human rights situation in the occupied Palestinian territories and in Israel is a central aspect of the conflict. There are reports of human rights violations from both sides, including unlawful killings, arbitrary detention, and torture.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Economic Consequences</strong><br>\nThe economic situation in the Palestinian territories is often precarious, with high unemployment and limited access to resources. The Israeli economy is more robust, but it also faces challenges and costs due to the ongoing conflict.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Future Prospects</strong><br>\nThe future of the conflict remains uncertain, with many obstacles on the path to a sustainable solution. Dialogue and negotiations between the parties, as well as the support of the international community, are crucial for promoting peace and justice in the region.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3d655444-fd55-42f7-aba2-16a16db7dc58"
